WEBVTT

00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:10.710
Why don't you join me?

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.950
Nia!

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:37.480
<i>Asura Cryin'</i>

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:55.250
"Bound by the Chains of Time"

00:01:57.460 --> 00:01:59.570
This is terrible!

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:02.550
I was supposed to protect her...

00:02:02.550 --> 00:02:05.200
...and now this.

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:06.930
Calm down, Tomo.

00:02:07.410 --> 00:02:08.510
Um...

00:02:08.990 --> 00:02:10.440
At a time like this...

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:15.150
We call Shuri.

00:02:18.750 --> 00:02:20.480
I guess we all had the same idea.

00:02:22.210 --> 00:02:24.040
We have to get her back.

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:27.350
Our sister.

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:30.290
Yeah.

00:02:35.530 --> 00:02:36.530
Shuri!

00:02:36.970 --> 00:02:38.220
What's wrong?

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:41.390
We lost Nia to the Asura Cryin'.

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:45.230
It's my fault.

00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:46.920
I made a mistake.

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:48.360
I even knew it would happen.

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:49.320
What?

00:02:49.320 --> 00:02:51.340
It's not entirely your fault, Tomoharu.

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:53.340
Shall we meet up?

00:02:53.790 --> 00:02:56.720
I found someone connected to the Asura Cryin'.

00:02:57.150 --> 00:02:58.500
The Asura Cryin'?

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:01.620
Got it.

00:03:02.250 --> 00:03:03.450
We're on our way.

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:06.530
A lead?

00:03:06.770 --> 00:03:08.300
I hope so.

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:09.310
Let's hurry.

00:03:12.150 --> 00:03:13.540
Stop him.

00:03:15.950 --> 00:03:17.000
What's wrong, Misao?

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:20.850
Did you hear that?

00:03:20.990 --> 00:03:21.760
Huh?

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:27.850
"Intermission"

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:31.520
Let me go!

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:33.440
Where is my sister?

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:35.750
There's something I want you to see.

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:46.750
Splitter.

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:50.600
I thought it was only a theory...

00:03:50.840 --> 00:03:52.380
...but it exists.

00:03:52.950 --> 00:03:54.590
Without Christina...

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:56.850
...it would have been hopeless.

00:03:57.420 --> 00:03:59.390
She is my saving grace.

00:04:00.310 --> 00:04:02.130
My sister told me...

00:04:02.610 --> 00:04:04.680
...she would stop researching the Splitter.

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:08.670
It's a terrifying system that can only be completed...

00:04:08.670 --> 00:04:10.500
...by sacrificing demons.

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:12.500
What did you do to my sister?

00:04:12.800 --> 00:04:14.390
What did you make her do?

00:04:14.870 --> 00:04:16.550
Where is she?

00:04:30.350 --> 00:04:33.810
Crystals have long been considered to purify the air...

00:04:33.810 --> 00:04:35.730
...and bring good luck.

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:38.570
Her body is currently...

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:41.060
...in need of luck.

00:04:55.340 --> 00:04:56.680
She's disappearing...

00:05:01.880 --> 00:05:02.930
Christina.

00:05:03.410 --> 00:05:04.930
She doesn't have much time.

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:08.360
She overextended herself making the Splitter.

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:10.360
How impudent.

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:12.110
You forced her to do it!

00:05:12.550 --> 00:05:13.700
Of course I did.

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:15.620
Why you...!

00:05:18.840 --> 00:05:22.160
You'll pay for betraying my sister!

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:24.750
Attacking me won't save Christina.

00:05:24.990 --> 00:05:26.200
Shut up!

00:05:26.390 --> 00:05:31.100
But I'm sure you would be able to ease her suffering.

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:32.680
What?

00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:34.940
I see what you mean.

00:05:35.760 --> 00:05:37.540
In order to use the Splitter...

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:41.620
...I need the luck eater's power to control probability.

00:05:42.060 --> 00:05:46.910
I'm not sure your sister would survive it, though.

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:49.700
You want me to take my sister's place?

00:05:50.270 --> 00:05:52.000
You don't have to.

00:05:52.440 --> 00:05:56.090
If you don't do it, your already disappearing sister...

00:05:56.620 --> 00:06:00.800
...will be put through hell.

00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:02.580
You coward!

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:04.210
I'll do anything...

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:07.190
...to lift the curse of the Asura Machina.

00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:09.190
Nia.

00:06:10.750 --> 00:06:12.050
Christina!

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:14.590
What are you doing here?

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:19.640
I'm sure you understand.

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:21.660
There can be no mistakes.

00:06:22.280 --> 00:06:23.820
Ania has nothing to do with this.

00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:27.430
I have a better chance with her than with you in that weakened state.

00:06:30.940 --> 00:06:32.520
I'll leave this door open.

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:35.020
The choice is yours...

00:06:35.600 --> 00:06:37.180
...Ania Fortuna.

00:06:56.990 --> 00:06:57.990
Shuri!

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:00.060
That was quick.

00:07:00.450 --> 00:07:01.360
Um...

00:07:02.030 --> 00:07:03.670
It's empty.

00:07:04.720 --> 00:07:05.830
This is him, right?

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:13.810
Takaya Kagakagari.

00:07:14.290 --> 00:07:15.490
Kagakagari.

00:07:15.780 --> 00:07:18.230
The person next to him looks like Nia.

00:07:18.570 --> 00:07:21.060
It must be Christina.

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:22.890
Who's this other one?

00:07:23.660 --> 00:07:25.010
Kotori Arayashiki.

00:07:25.770 --> 00:07:27.020
This is her room.

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:31.350
Two years ago, she was a student teacher at Rakurowa High School.

00:07:31.830 --> 00:07:35.390
That's the same time Nia's sister was studying here.

00:07:36.060 --> 00:07:37.840
There could be something here.

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:39.840
Let's search the room.

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:41.680
Hurry.

00:07:43.410 --> 00:07:44.760
What's wrong, Misao?

00:07:45.430 --> 00:07:47.400
Who are you?

00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:49.180
Did you hear that voice again?

00:07:49.760 --> 00:07:52.450
Huh? What about the demons?

00:07:53.310 --> 00:07:55.620
Many? Many what?

00:07:56.010 --> 00:07:59.130
Ask her where she is, Misao.

00:07:59.320 --> 00:08:00.190
"She?"

00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:05.710
She says it's there.

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:15.710
What is this?

00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:19.030
I can't believe it's this large scale.

00:08:19.460 --> 00:08:20.370
Huh?

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:23.020
This is much bigger than demon hunting.

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:24.890
It's an unbelievable ritual.

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:26.570
What do you mean?

00:08:27.490 --> 00:08:29.600
Who is Misao talking to?

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:31.430
I'll explain later.

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:32.490
Let's go.

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:35.900
Kagakagari is at the Old Horizon Theater.

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:40.800
Leave.

00:08:41.230 --> 00:08:43.730
I won't go anywhere without you!

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:47.240
I'm no longer the Christina you know.

00:08:47.480 --> 00:08:48.390
No!

00:08:48.680 --> 00:08:51.810
I'm about to sacrifice many of my own.

00:08:52.290 --> 00:08:53.490
Christina.

00:08:54.020 --> 00:08:56.040
All the magic I've gathered...

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:58.680
...is for powering the Splitter.

00:08:59.160 --> 00:09:01.800
To break the curse of the Asura Machina...

00:09:01.800 --> 00:09:03.920
...I need the blood of all this city's demons.

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:06.420
That won't be all.

00:09:06.420 --> 00:09:08.680
Entering the other world...

00:09:08.680 --> 00:09:10.600
...will disrupt space-time.

00:09:10.890 --> 00:09:12.380
If you fail...

00:09:12.380 --> 00:09:15.210
...we don't know what will happen to this world.

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:17.470
I have to do it.

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:19.470
Is it for him?

00:09:21.850 --> 00:09:23.380
How can you do this?

00:09:23.380 --> 00:09:26.220
He betrayed you and threw you away!

00:09:26.890 --> 00:09:29.390
How can you do this for someone like that?

00:09:31.310 --> 00:09:33.810
Without love, I simply disappear.

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:36.170
Stop this!

00:09:37.030 --> 00:09:40.110
I won't let you disappear!

00:09:41.360 --> 00:09:42.850
I won't let you.

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:55.390
No!

00:09:55.390 --> 00:09:57.560
I need all your handlers!

00:09:57.560 --> 00:09:58.710
Immediately!

00:09:59.140 --> 00:10:00.580
I'll take command!

00:10:02.170 --> 00:10:04.670
You're arrogant, Kyomu.

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:07.600
I won't let them have their way!

00:10:08.030 --> 00:10:10.050
It'll sure be something if you can solve this one.

00:10:10.530 --> 00:10:13.030
I'm the only one for the job.

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:18.080
Where are you, Haruna?

00:10:18.270 --> 00:10:20.870
I think I found Kagakagari.

00:10:21.060 --> 00:10:22.020
I see.

00:10:22.550 --> 00:10:23.700
Shall we join you?

00:10:25.910 --> 00:10:27.840
That would be encouraging.

00:10:28.460 --> 00:10:31.730
I can't promise I'll be waiting, though.

00:10:33.220 --> 00:10:34.470
What was that about?

00:10:34.950 --> 00:10:36.870
She found a lead.

00:10:37.300 --> 00:10:38.220
What?

00:10:38.460 --> 00:10:39.850
Looks like she beat you to it.

00:10:52.010 --> 00:10:54.510
Has she really changed?

00:10:55.180 --> 00:10:57.590
Forget me.

00:10:58.070 --> 00:10:59.460
I don't understand.

00:11:00.330 --> 00:11:01.820
I can't accept this.

00:11:02.630 --> 00:11:04.510
Walk your own path.

00:11:06.620 --> 00:11:07.730
You're right.

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:12.490
I'll power the Splitter.

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:14.460
That changes nothing.

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:15.990
If that thing moves...

00:11:15.990 --> 00:11:17.770
...I'll be sacrificed...

00:11:17.770 --> 00:11:19.450
I'll finish it before then.

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:38.100
You have my thanks, Ania Fortuna.

00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:46.130
If I destroy it...

00:11:46.130 --> 00:11:47.670
...this will all be over.

00:11:50.740 --> 00:11:52.280
What is this place?

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:55.360
It's starting.

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:58.400
"Performance in progress"

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:06.120
A demon always keeps its word.

00:12:06.940 --> 00:12:09.010
Humans are always the ones that break the contract.

00:12:09.490 --> 00:12:11.010
I won't make excuses.

00:12:11.550 --> 00:12:13.430
Do it.

00:12:14.010 --> 00:12:15.830
It'll be over soon.

00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:19.390
Splitter.

00:12:19.390 --> 00:12:23.040
A contraption that mimics the Asura Machina's system...

00:12:23.040 --> 00:12:26.360
...to remove the burial doll.

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:30.010
But perfect systems don't exist in this world.

00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:33.810
If I increase the chance of a mishap occuring...

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:35.540
...then this thing...!

00:12:41.930 --> 00:12:44.530
My powers aren't working.

00:12:46.020 --> 00:12:47.460
It's a safeguard.

00:12:50.820 --> 00:12:54.040
I guess I'll have to get Christina to do it.

00:12:54.760 --> 00:12:55.720
No!

00:12:56.200 --> 00:12:57.890
My sister will die!

00:12:58.220 --> 00:13:00.580
You're the one that killed her.

00:13:04.950 --> 00:13:07.450
My sister...

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:09.450
My sister...

00:13:10.190 --> 00:13:11.450
...will die!

00:13:16.530 --> 00:13:17.830
Tomoharu.

00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:20.090
Nia!

00:13:20.090 --> 00:13:21.000
Nia!

00:13:27.930 --> 00:13:28.980
It's this!

00:13:29.130 --> 00:13:30.760
Destroy it!

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:33.260
That's my specialty!

00:13:44.460 --> 00:13:46.380
Ania Fortuna!

00:13:46.960 --> 00:13:48.640
This ends now!

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:50.640
The Splitter is proof of my love.

00:14:03.780 --> 00:14:04.930
Kagakagari!

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:08.870
Unlike you, I don't have much time.

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:13.150
Get out of my way.

00:14:16.810 --> 00:14:17.670
Misao!

00:14:17.670 --> 00:14:18.390
Okay!

00:14:18.970 --> 00:14:20.460
Come, Kurogane!

00:14:39.010 --> 00:14:42.040
I can stop time...

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:45.020
...but our clock keeps ticking.

00:14:45.930 --> 00:14:46.990
How ironic.

00:14:50.260 --> 00:14:53.960
The pain ends now.

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:56.840
Make no mistakes.

00:15:00.110 --> 00:15:01.700
Trust me.

00:15:10.060 --> 00:15:13.040
You'll be safe in here.

00:15:13.280 --> 00:15:15.300
Don't do it!

00:15:16.400 --> 00:15:18.470
I'm glad I got to see you.

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:20.100
No.

00:15:23.660 --> 00:15:24.720
Christina!

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:46.870
This can't be good.

00:15:47.160 --> 00:15:49.130
I won't let Haruna take all the credit.

00:15:59.080 --> 00:16:00.570
Where am I?

00:16:02.250 --> 00:16:03.410
There's nothing.

00:16:03.700 --> 00:16:05.090
I can't hear anything.

00:16:05.430 --> 00:16:07.110
Am I dead?

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:09.900
You're fine.

00:16:10.180 --> 00:16:11.000
Huh?

00:16:11.190 --> 00:16:13.000
I'm with you.

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:19.990
What?

00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:24.270
Kurogane!

00:16:24.700 --> 00:16:25.800
I see.

00:16:25.800 --> 00:16:28.690
He neutralized the time stop with a singularity effect.

00:16:34.120 --> 00:16:34.980
Takatsuki!

00:16:35.710 --> 00:16:38.060
Stop the ritual, Tomoharu!

00:16:38.060 --> 00:16:39.170
Yes!

00:16:39.700 --> 00:16:43.590
You should have remained bound by the chains of time.

00:16:59.590 --> 00:17:03.290
The circulation of magic creates unbelievable power.

00:17:03.920 --> 00:17:08.530
The Asura Cryin' has no limits.

00:17:08.680 --> 00:17:11.270
Then I'll have to stop that circulation.

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:21.370
Nice to meet you.

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:22.900
I'm Haruna Chiyohara.

00:17:24.920 --> 00:17:26.510
A G.D.

00:17:26.800 --> 00:17:27.710
Ingrid!

00:17:34.870 --> 00:17:37.130
Come, Aenka.

00:17:40.640 --> 00:17:43.190
Looks like you're out of time, miss.

00:17:43.760 --> 00:17:47.610
The world began with a giant explosion.

00:17:47.850 --> 00:17:52.510
That would make everything in the world part of an explosion.

00:17:53.520 --> 00:17:54.670
A fuse?

00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:01.210
Now, Mr. Natsume!

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:02.990
Yes!

00:18:02.990 --> 00:18:03.800
Kurogane!

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:07.360
No!

00:18:13.420 --> 00:18:14.520
Rhodonite!

00:18:35.290 --> 00:18:36.250
Christy!

00:18:41.340 --> 00:18:42.400
Christiana.

00:18:44.900 --> 00:18:45.760
What?

00:18:46.240 --> 00:18:48.310
Tell me, boy.

00:18:50.180 --> 00:18:52.540
You should have been able...

00:18:53.160 --> 00:18:56.430
...to have power equal to mine.

00:18:56.720 --> 00:18:59.600
Why didn't you make a contract with that demon?

00:19:00.610 --> 00:19:02.870
Takatsuki isn't a tool.

00:19:03.550 --> 00:19:04.870
You're young.

00:19:05.130 --> 00:19:06.770
Remember this, boy.

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:09.410
You don't save anyone like that.

00:19:25.030 --> 00:19:27.240
Let's hurry, everyone!

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:42.430
The immediate threat of the demon hunter is gone.

00:19:42.430 --> 00:19:45.220
It's unfortunate Kagakagari escaped, though.

00:19:45.790 --> 00:19:47.520
He's an Asura Cryin'.

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:48.970
You did well.

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:50.460
I agree.

00:19:50.460 --> 00:19:53.290
But if it had been me, I would have captured him.

00:19:54.680 --> 00:19:57.810
It was a device to remove the burial doll.

00:19:58.340 --> 00:20:00.160
Right, Nia?

00:20:00.360 --> 00:20:02.660
So you knew?

00:20:03.050 --> 00:20:05.350
So that means Kagakagari's goal...

00:20:05.590 --> 00:20:06.800
Exactly.

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:11.460
He had my sister make that thing...

00:20:11.460 --> 00:20:13.460
...to remove the girl bound inside Rhodonite.

00:20:13.460 --> 00:20:16.940
But it didn't seem like he wanted to do it.

00:20:17.660 --> 00:20:21.840
I don't want to sacrifice others.

00:20:24.340 --> 00:20:26.070
There's much we don't know.

00:20:27.170 --> 00:20:31.450
How did something so powerful stay hidden so long?

00:20:32.030 --> 00:20:36.310
Where did he get Rhodonite?

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:38.370
The only thing that's certain...

00:20:38.370 --> 00:20:41.980
...is my sister helped him of her own volition.

00:20:42.410 --> 00:20:43.710
Uh...

00:20:43.710 --> 00:20:44.570
What?

00:20:44.570 --> 00:20:46.400
Um, well...

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:50.390
...what happened to your sister's body?

00:20:52.410 --> 00:20:54.040
You don't know?

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:56.040
She was vanishing.

00:20:56.440 --> 00:20:58.560
It's what happens when demons use up their power.

00:20:59.280 --> 00:21:00.290
Look at Shuri.

00:21:00.670 --> 00:21:02.120
She's beautiful...

00:21:02.120 --> 00:21:03.410
...but she can't hide her wrinkles.

00:21:03.850 --> 00:21:04.520
What?

00:21:05.140 --> 00:21:06.780
It's the same idea.

00:21:07.310 --> 00:21:08.270
Don't worry about it.

00:21:10.090 --> 00:21:11.200
But nevermind that.

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:12.790
You really moved me.

00:21:13.270 --> 00:21:15.290
Takatsuki isn't a tool.

00:21:15.860 --> 00:21:17.830
You're not so bad after all.

00:21:18.600 --> 00:21:20.760
I was just stating the obvious.

00:21:21.820 --> 00:21:24.370
You seem really calm, Nia.

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:26.720
What do you mean?

00:21:27.110 --> 00:21:30.950
Your sister is gone again.

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:33.840
That must be where she belongs.

00:21:34.410 --> 00:21:37.390
Just as this is where I belong.

00:21:38.070 --> 00:21:39.800
There's no time.

00:21:40.710 --> 00:21:42.300
That's what Kagakagari said.

00:21:43.500 --> 00:21:44.650
He'll turn up again.

00:21:46.810 --> 00:21:48.300
I have a feeling we'll see him again.

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:24.770
"Preview"

00:23:20.630 --> 00:23:22.070
My 10,000 yen.

00:23:22.070 --> 00:23:22.750
Madam.

00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:23.900
Splendid.

00:23:23.900 --> 00:23:24.810
Macho.

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:25.870
I'll be with you.

00:23:25.870 --> 00:23:27.020
Brilliant.

00:23:27.020 --> 00:23:30.290
I'm sure we'll be happy.

00:23:30.290 --> 00:23:35.080
"Together in the Ordinary and Extraordinary"
